{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32093","headline":"题郑常侍厅前竹 · 贾岛","name":"题郑常侍厅前竹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绿竹临诗酒，婵娟思不穷。\n乱枝低积雪，繁叶亚寒风。\n萧飒疑泉过，萦回有迳通。\n侵庭根出土，隔壁笋成丛。\n疎影纱窗外，清音宝瑟中。\n卷帘终日看，欹枕几秋同。\n万顷歌王子，千竿伴阮公。\n露光怜片片，雨润爱蒙蒙。\n嶰谷蛮湖北，湘川灀水东。\n何如轩槛侧，苍翠褭长空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32093.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32093","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}